
# Glowify - Skincare Landing Page

## Project Overview
Glowify is a responsive skincare landing page developed as part of the Oasis Infobyte Web Development Internship - Level 1, Task 1.

The website introduces a skincare brand with a clean design, attractive images, and a nature-inspired colour palette.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- CSS Flexbox
- CSS Grid
- CSS Media Queries

## Features
- Navigation bar with Home, Features, About, and Contacts links
- Hero section with a headline and call-to-action button
- Skincare features section
- About section with an image
- Testimonials section
- Contact and social media links
- Responsive layout for mobile and desktop screens

